    "masking_description": "Randomization to either the placebo or empagliflozin group will be performed using a secure web-based system and allocation of empagliflozin vs. placebo in 1:1 ratio. The allocation of the study group will remain blinded to both participants and all study staff and investigators until the completion of the study. Participants will receive encapsulated empagliflozin and matching placebo.",
